#: kbugreport.cc:118
msgid ""
"Enter the text (in English if possible) that you wish to submit for the bug "
"report.\n"
"If you press \"OK\", a mail message will be sent to the maintainer of this "
"program \n"
"and to the KDE buglist."
msgstr ""
"Tik die teks (in Engels indien moontlik) wat u graag as 'n foutverslag wil "
"indien.\n"
"Indien u \"OK\" druk sal 'n E-pos aan die onderhouer van hierdie program en "
"aan die KDE \n"
"foutlys gestuur word."

#: kbugreport.cc:136
msgid "You can access previously reported bugs and wishes at "
msgstr "U kan vorige gerapporteerde foute en wense besigtig by "

#: kbugreport.cc:197
msgid ""
"Couldn't send the bug report.\n"
"Hmmm, submit a bug report manually, sorry...\n"
msgstr ""
"Kon nie die foutverslag instuur nie.\n"
"Jammer, stuur asb. die verslag met 'n ander metode.\n"

#: kbugreport.cc:199
msgid "Bug report sent, thanks for your input."
msgstr "Foutverslag gestuur, dankie vir u inset."

